  "notes": "{送信|そうしん} is used specifically for electronic or signal transmission. For physically sending letters or packages, {送|おく}る or {発送|はっそう} is used instead.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {送信|そうしん}する: to send (electronically)\n- {送信|そうしん}ボタン: send button\n- {送信|そうしん}{取|と}り{消|け}し: unsend, recall message\n- {送信|そうしん}{者|しゃ}: sender\n- {送信|そうしん}{済|ず}み: sent (status)\n- {送信|そうしん}{先|さき}: recipient address/destination\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {送信|そうしん}: sending (electronic) ↔ {受信|じゅしん}: receiving\n- {送信|そうしん}: electronic transmission ↔ {発送|はっそう}: shipping (physical)\n- {送|おく}る: general \"to send\" — covers both physical and electronic",
